    {
      "id": "claim_7ce05a58c8d94282a493515fd0f8400d",
      "statement": "getaddrinfo ENOTFOUND keycloak-service when running the integration tier in the devcontainer shell is caused by .env.docker (loaded by tests/integration/setup/env.ts for CI) containing Docker-internal hostnames not overridden for a host-shell run. Fix: export KEYCLOAK_URL=http://localhost:8099, MONGO_URL=mongodb://localhost:27018, REDIS_TEST_URL=redis://localhost:6379/1. Measured 2026-08-09: 84 failed/31 passed without these exports; 114/115 with them.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/devcontainer.md#L768-L780",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ab0f1e1be9e2c3706ec92e0a96194db98014cf739529ae52f01ae3759bb251f8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_819741c15da241faa3df0b4af200f36b",
      "statement": "Local Ollama runs inside the devcontainer via the dev-ollama nested container (scripts/devcontainer-ollama.sh, run at postStartCommand), publishing on 0.0.0.0:11434 so nested containers can reach it via host.docker.internal. The agent gateway targets host.docker.internal:11434 and reaches dev-ollama with no gateway change, image rebuild, or firewall change.",
