    {
      "id": "claim_7c0f0e5f8b9243568e622be32480691e",
      "statement": "The Android SDK and an android-34 google_apis x86_64 system image are baked into the toolchain image; the privileged DinD container passes through the host /dev/kvm, enabling a headless hardware-accelerated emulator boot. An older MCM_DEVCONTAINER_IMAGE silently has no Android layer and devcontainer-android.sh no-ops cleanly rather than erroring.",
      "evidence": [
