    {
      "id": "claim_3405e36d6162483294a06e52d5dd03d9",
      "statement": "~/.claude.json (Claude Code's global config holding oauthAccount, userID, machineID, and session history) is a sibling of the ~/.claude directory in $HOME on the ephemeral overlay and was NOT persisted by the mcm-claude volume. Fix: CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=/home/coder/.claude in containerEnv relocates the config root onto the volume (item #257, measured 2026-08-27). A symlink does not work because Claude Code replaces the file via write-then-rename, swapping the symlink for a regular overlay file.",
